{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026i5dBpDAriT1793143623.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>華能國際電力股份截至九月底止第三季度按年少賺近七成八，純利逾12億元人民幣。扣除非經常性損益純利，逾8億元人民幣，倒退八成四。主要由於境內上網電量及平均上網結算電價下降，以及單位售電燃料成本上升。</p><p></p><p>期內收入跌百分之3，至589億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.579129+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.063798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:15.408868+00:00","content_hash":"3f5483854843e6d6485b7539249514cd148e6a4657fe3cf7781271637eb4867c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.579129+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}